# fmt: on
#
# The Python Imaging Library.
# $Id$
#
# Basic McIdas support for PIL
#
# History:
# 1997-05-05 fl  Created (8-bit images only)
# 2009-03-08 fl  Added 16/32-bit support.
#
# Thanks to Richard Jones and Craig Swank for specs and samples.
#
