# The Python Imaging Library
# $Id$
#
# portable compiled font file parser
#
# history:
# 1997-08-19 fl   created
# 2003-09-13 fl   fixed loading of unicode fonts
#
# Copyright (c) 1997-2003 by Secret Labs AB.
